  "contentHtml": "Хамгийн их персингтэй бүсгүйгээр шалгарч гиннесийн номонд орсон Элейн \nДэвидсон хэмээх&nbsp; бүсгүй хуримлалаа. 42 настай тэрээр гоёлын даашинз, \nээмэг гангараанаас гадна биеийн ил харагдах хэсгүүдээ өнгө өнгөөр \nбудан&nbsp; <span></span>6925 ширхэг&nbsp; ээмэг бөгж биеийнхээ энд тэндээс зүүжээ. Харин нөхөр нь болох Дуглас Уотсон сонгодог хуримын&nbsp; хувцасаар гоёжээ.<br><!--IMG2--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120214182027im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/98903897.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120214182027im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/14398216.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/90172169.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120214182027im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/s90172169.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/66045053.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120214182027im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/s66045053.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/48634360.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120214182027im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/s48634360.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><a href=\"http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/74022308.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120214182027im_/http://laitai.ucoz.com/_nw/24/s74022308.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><a hre